evel has hidden damage skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220710/extras/1874d0d304f890ef5eed6c312120da54.avif?t=1677495535\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220710/extras_big/1874d0d304f890ef5eed6c312120da54.avif?t=1677495535 width=800 height=450 /></span><br>2. Select a hero:<br>You have 3 heroes to choose from. Each hero has an advanced skill. Using the advanced skill can cause double damage to the enemy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220710/extras/ffa91a972e756f7e604a88946c1c283f.avif?t=1677495535\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220710/extras_big/ffa91a972e756f7e604a88946c1c283f.avif?t=1677495535 width=800 height=450 /></span><br>3. Composite hero:<br>After obtaining the energy gem, you can generate a companion, and the combined companion can increase the number of attacks, defend the home with the companion, and eliminate the incoming enemy.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2220710?t=1677495535","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2220710?t=1677495535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1677495535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1677495535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220710/extras/f4cb8c1a721e37e0d2687dee4b4ec942.poster.avi